{"id":"n66030-1-12","stage":1,"title":"많이 · 多","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66030-1-12-1","ko":"엄마, 배가 너무 아파요.","zh":"妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"腹部","explanation":"배：腹部；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"腹部","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中消化食物的肠胃等内脏所在的部位。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/101d48f3e325ea0e1906.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66030-1-12-2","ko":"밥을 많이 먹더니 결국 배탈이 났네. 그러게 조금만 먹으라고 했잖아.","zh":"吃了那么多饭，结果肠胃不适了。我就说让你少吃点嘛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥을","audio":"/audio/59f360b400889823dcc4.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹더니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹더니","audio":"/audio/f6c283b459ffe3ebeb3e.mp3"}},{"text":"결국","meaning":"最后，终于","explanation":"결국：最后，终于。","readings":[{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17260","senseId":"1","lemma":"결국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}},{"text":"배탈이","meaning":"腹痛，腹泻","explanation":"배탈：腹痛，腹泻；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배탈","audio":"/audio/589abc9abd174bd38d91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58720","senseId":"1","lemma":"배탈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배탈이","audio":"/audio/3b41e124a5a26486d1d0.mp3"}},{"text":"났네.","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났네","audio":"/audio/61838fe700d98744d637.mp3"}},{"text":"그러게","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으라고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으라고：转述命令、请求或劝告。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으라고","audio":"/audio/ee4ca6ae1ed0261e19ac.mp3"}},{"text":"했잖아.","meaning":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","explanation":"하다：说、转述（引用前面的话）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했잖아","audio":"/audio/946efc19d51cb603a2b1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"a1a5375588e265b0","term":"결국","zh":"最后，终于","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3","entryId":"17260","definition":"作为事情的结果。","pronunciation":["결국"]},{"id":"589abc9abd174bd3","term":"배탈","zh":"腹痛，腹泻","audio":"/audio/589abc9abd174bd38d91.mp3","entryId":"58720","definition":"出现消化不良、拉肚子或肚子疼等症状的疾病。","pronunciation":["배탈"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说、转述（引用前面的话）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fcb4b32d365ca3ffb151.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.885,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66030","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.553,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["吃了那么多饭，结果肠胃不适了。我就说让你少吃点嘛。","妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害。","为什么您这么频繁地上厕所呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我肚子疼得厉害。","为什么您这么频繁地上厕所呢？","吃了那么多饭，结果肠胃不适了。我就说让你少吃点嘛。"],"answer":2}]}
